{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2008-deet-science2-19","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2008,"subject":"chemistry","number":19,"points":null,"unitId":"organic_rxn","unitLabel":"유기 반응","topic":"합성·E1·탈수","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["organic_rxn"],"stem":"그림은2'-hydroxyacetophenone (A)을출발물질로하여항산화성을\n갖는Flavone을합성하는과정이다.\nO\nOH\nO\nC6H5COX, pyridine\n1) KOH/pyridine, \n2) H3O+\nCH2Cl2, 0 oC\nO\nO\nA                                                             B\nOH\nO\nO\nO\nC\nH2SO4\nCH3COOH\nO\nOH\nFlavone\nO\nOH\nD\n이에대한설명으로옳은것을<보기>에서모두고른것은?\n<보기>\nㄱ. A →B의전환에서X에따른C6H5COX의반응성크기는\nX ＝－Cl ＜－OC2H5이다.\nㄴ. B →C의전환은6원자고리중간체를거쳐서일어나는\n자리옮김이다.\nㄷ. C ⇄D의전환은케토-엔올이성질화이며, C와D는토토머\n관계이다.\nㄹ. C (또는D) →Flavone의전환은고리화탈수로일어나며,\n황산은촉매로작용한다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030","t031","t032","t033","t034","t035"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t036"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t037"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t038"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t039"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t040"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":771,"height":715,"region":0,"bbox":[14.456,47.948,308.4,286.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2008-deet-science2-19/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":772,"height":393,"region":0,"bbox":[14.456,375.148,308.8,157.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t027","t028","t029","t030","t031","t0